#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:52
msgid "What's Next"
msgstr "Qué seguís"

#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:53
msgid "Gramplet suggesting items to research"
msgstr "Gramplet que suggerís d'elements de recercar"

#: WhatsNext.gpr.py:66
msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "Qué seguís ?"

#: WhatsNext.py:129
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Ajuda"

#: WhatsNext.py:206
msgid "People"
msgstr "Personas"

#: WhatsNext.py:210
msgid "Unknown first name"
msgstr "Pichon nom desconegut"

#: WhatsNext.py:211
msgid "Report a person without a first name"
msgstr "Senhalar una persona sens pichon nom"

#: WhatsNext.py:213
msgid "Unknown surname"
msgstr "Nom d'ostal desconegut"

#: WhatsNext.py:213
msgid "Report a person without a surname"
msgstr "Senhalar una persona sens nom d'ostal"

#: WhatsNext.py:216
msgid "Missing Birth event"
msgstr "Eveniment Naissença mancant"

#: WhatsNext.py:217
msgid "Report a person without a Birth event"
msgstr "Senhalar una persona sens eveniment Naissença"

#: WhatsNext.py:221
msgid "Birth date and place"
msgstr "Data e luòc de naissença"

#: WhatsNext.py:222
msgid "Check the date and place of the Birth event"
msgstr "Verificar la data e lo luòc de l'eveniment Naissença"

#: WhatsNext.py:226
msgid "Missing Death event"
msgstr "Eveniment Decès mancant"

#: WhatsNext.py:228
msgid ""
"Report a person without a Death event, when Gramps judges from the dates of "
"the person and relatives that the person is no longer alive"
msgstr ""
"Senhalar una persona sens eveniment Decès, quand Gramps estima a partir de "
"las datas de la persona e de sos parents qu'es pas pus en vida"

#: WhatsNext.py:235
msgid "Death date and place"
msgstr "Data e luòc de decès"

#: WhatsNext.py:236
msgid "Check the date and place of the Death event"
msgstr "Verificar la data e lo luòc de l'eveniment Decès"

#: WhatsNext.py:241
msgid "Families"
msgstr "Familhas"

#: WhatsNext.py:245
msgid "Unknown relationship type"
msgstr "Tipe de relacion desconegut"

#: WhatsNext.py:246
msgid "Report a family with the relationship type \"Unknown\""
msgstr "Senhalar una familha amb lo tipe de relacion « Desconegut »"

#: WhatsNext.py:250
msgid "Missing Marriage event"
msgstr "Eveniment Maridatge mancant"

#: WhatsNext.py:251
msgid "Report a family of the \"Married\" type without a Marriage event"
msgstr "Senhalar una familha de tipe « Maridats » sens eveniment Maridatge"

#: WhatsNext.py:255
msgid "Marriage date and place"
msgstr "Data e luòc del maridatge"

#: WhatsNext.py:256
msgid "Check the date and place of the Marriage event"
msgstr "Verificar la data e lo luòc de l'eveniment Maridatge"

#: WhatsNext.py:260
msgid "Divorce date and place"
msgstr "Data e luòc del divòrci"

#: WhatsNext.py:261
msgid "Check the date and place of the Divorce event"
msgstr "Verificar la data e lo luòc de l'eveniment Divòrci"

#: WhatsNext.py:266
msgid "Relationships"
msgstr "Relacions"

#: WhatsNext.py:270
msgid "Missing parent family"
msgstr "Familha parentala mancanta"

#: WhatsNext.py:271
msgid "List each person who has no parent family"
msgstr "Listar cada persona sens familha parentala"

#: WhatsNext.py:275
msgid "Missing partner"
msgstr "Conjunt mancant"

#: WhatsNext.py:276
msgid "Report a family with only one partner"
msgstr "Senhalar una familha amb un sol conjunt"

#: WhatsNext.py:280
msgid "Missing father"
msgstr "Paire mancant"

#: WhatsNext.py:281
msgid "Report a person whose parent family has no father"
msgstr "Senhalar una persona que sa familha parentala a pas de paire"

#: WhatsNext.py:285
msgid "Missing mother"
msgstr "Maire mancanta"

#: WhatsNext.py:286
msgid "Report a person whose parent family has no mother"
msgstr "Senhalar una persona que sa familha parentala a pas de maire"

#: WhatsNext.py:291
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Eveniments"

#: WhatsNext.py:293
msgid "Unknown date"
msgstr "Data desconeguda"

#: WhatsNext.py:293
msgid "Report an event without a date"
msgstr "Senhalar un eveniment sens data"

#: WhatsNext.py:296
msgid "Date is text only"
msgstr "La data es solament de tèxte"

#: WhatsNext.py:297
msgid "Report a date that Gramps could not read as a date"
msgstr "Senhalar una data que Gramps a pas poscut legir coma una data"

#: WhatsNext.py:301
msgid "Inexact date"
msgstr "Data inexacta"

#: WhatsNext.py:303
msgid ""
"Report a range, a span, or a date with \"before\", \"after\", \"about\", "
"\"estimated\" or \"calculated\""
msgstr ""
"Senhalar un interval, un periòde o una data amb « abans », « aprèp », « cap "
"a », « estimada » o « calculada »"

#: WhatsNext.py:309
msgid "Incomplete date"
msgstr "Data incompleta"

#: WhatsNext.py:310
msgid "Report a single date without its day or month"
msgstr "Senhalar una data simpla sens jorn o sens mes"

#: WhatsNext.py:312
msgid "Unknown place"
msgstr "Luòc desconegut"

#: WhatsNext.py:312
msgid "Report an event without a place"
msgstr "Senhalar un eveniment sens luòc"

#: WhatsNext.py:330
msgid "Enter the missing name in the Edit Person dialog."
msgstr "Picatz lo nom mancant dins la fenèstra Editar la persona."

#: WhatsNext.py:331
msgid "Add via the Events tab of the Edit Person dialog."
msgstr "Apondètz-lo per l'onglet Eveniments de la fenèstra Editar la persona."

#: WhatsNext.py:333
msgid ""
"Open the event on the Events tab of the Edit Person dialog, and complete its"
" date and place."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz l'eveniment dins l'onglet Eveniments de la fenèstra Editar la "
"persona, e completatz sa data e son luòc."

#: WhatsNext.py:337
msgid ""
"Open the event on the Events tab of the Edit Family dialog, and complete its"
" date and place."
msgstr ""
"Dobrissètz l'eveniment dins l'onglet Eveniments de la fenèstra Editar la "
"familha, e completatz sa data e son luòc."

#: WhatsNext.py:340
msgid "Add a Marriage event on the Events tab of the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr ""
"Apondètz un eveniment Maridatge dins l'onglet Eveniments de la fenèstra "
"Editar la familha."

#: WhatsNext.py:341
msgid "Choose the relationship \"Type\" in the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr ""
"Causissètz lo « Tipe » de relacion dins la fenèstra Editar la familha."

#: WhatsNext.py:342
msgid "Add the missing partner in the Edit Family dialog."
msgstr "Apondètz lo conjunt mancant dins la fenèstra Editar la familha."

#: WhatsNext.py:343
msgid "Add the father in the Edit Family dialog of the parent family."
msgstr ""
"Apondètz lo paire dins la fenèstra Editar la familha de la familha "
"parentala."

#: WhatsNext.py:344
msgid "Add the mother in the Edit Family dialog of the parent family."
msgstr ""
"Apondètz la maire dins la fenèstra Editar la familha de la familha "
"parentala."

#: WhatsNext.py:346
msgid ""
"In the Relationships view, choose \"Add New Parents...\" or \"Add Existing "
"Parents...\" from the Edit menu."
msgstr ""
"Dins la vista Relacions, causissètz « Apondre de parents novèls... » o "
"« Apondre de parents existents... » dins lo menú Edicion."

#: WhatsNext.py:400
msgid "Completed"
msgstr "Acabat"

#: WhatsNext.py:402
msgid "Ignored"
msgstr "Ignorat"

#: WhatsNext.py:404
msgid "Pruned"
msgstr "Podat"

#: WhatsNext.py:546
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ A local Genealogical Tree database has not yet been loaded.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Cap de basa de donadas locala d'arbre genealogic es pas encara cargada.\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:548
msgid " 👣 Next Steps:\n"
msgstr " 👣 Etapas seguentas :\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:549
msgid "  •  From the \"Family Trees\" menu,"
msgstr "  •  Dins lo menú « Arbres familials »,"

#: WhatsNext.py:550
msgid " use the \"Manage Family Trees...\" option to"
msgstr " utilizatz l'opcion « Gestion dels arbres familials... » per"

#: WhatsNext.py:551
msgid " create a New (or to select an existing) Tree database.\n"
msgstr ""
" crear una basa de donadas d'arbre novèla (o ne seleccionar una "
"existenta).\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:552
msgid "  •  Click the \"Load Family Tree\" button to begin"
msgstr "  •  Clicatz sul boton « Cargar l'arbre familial » per començar"

#: WhatsNext.py:553
msgid ""
" working with the selected genealogical tree.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" a trabalhar amb l'arbre genealogic seleccionat.\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:556
msgid ""
"To use a backup from Gramps, or a GEDCOM file from another genealogical tool, choose \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Per utilizar una salvagarda de Gramps, o un fichièr GEDCOM d'una autra aisina genealogica, causissètz « Importar... » dins lo menú « Arbres familials ».\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:562
msgid ""
"To use a backup from Gramps, or a GEDCOM file from another genealogical tool, first create and load a new, empty tree. Then choose \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Per utilizar una salvagarda de Gramps, o un fichièr GEDCOM d'una autra aisina genealogica, creatz e cargatz d'en primièr un arbre novèl e void. Puèi causissètz « Importar... » dins lo menú « Arbres familials ».\n"
"\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:622
msgid "Use the \"Configure\" in the \"View\" menu to change the Gramplet options."
msgstr ""
"Utilizatz « Configuracion... » dins lo menú « Afichatge » per modificar las "
"opcions del gramplet."

#: WhatsNext.py:680 WhatsNext.py:1297
msgid "Organize Tags"
msgstr "Organizar las etiquetas"

#: WhatsNext.py:719
msgid "Complete"
msgstr "Acabar"

#: WhatsNext.py:720
msgid "Tag listed People and Families as Completed"
msgstr "Etiquetar las personas e familhas listadas coma Acabadas"

#: WhatsNext.py:729
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Ignorar"

#: WhatsNext.py:730
msgid "Tag to Ignore People and Families"
msgstr "Etiquetar de personas e familhas d'ignorar"

#: WhatsNext.py:739
msgid "Prune"
msgstr "Podar"

#: WhatsNext.py:741
msgid "Tag to Prune (exclude) listed People and Families from testing"
msgstr ""
"Etiquetar las personas e familhas listadas de podar (exclure) de las "
"verificacions"

#: WhatsNext.py:820
msgid "Search Quota "
msgstr "Quòta de recèrca "

#: WhatsNext.py:824
msgid ""
"The least number of lines to show. The search stops once this many problems "
"are found"
msgstr ""
"Lo nombre minimal de linhas d'afichar. La recèrca s'arrèsta tre que tant de "
"problèmas son trobats"

#: WhatsNext.py:832
msgid "Depth per loop"
msgstr "Prigondor per bocla"

#: WhatsNext.py:836
msgid ""
"How many generations of descendants to check before going up one more "
"generation of ancestors"
msgstr ""
"Nombre de generacions de descendents de verificar abans de remontar d'una "
"generacion d'ascendents"

#: WhatsNext.py:844
msgid "Pause search expansion"
msgstr "Pausa dins l'extension de la recèrca"

#: WhatsNext.py:848
msgid ""
"How many extra rounds to wait after checking an ancestor before checking the"
" descendants of that ancestor"
msgstr ""
"Nombre de torns suplementaris d'esperar aprèp la verificacion d'un ascendent"
" abans de verificar sos descendents"

#: WhatsNext.py:856
msgid "Complete tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta Acabat"

#: WhatsNext.py:857
msgid "Finished. Hide the object, and keep searching through it"
msgstr "Acabat. Amagar l'objècte e contunhar la recèrca a travèrs el"

#: WhatsNext.py:862
msgid "Ignore tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta Ignorat"

#: WhatsNext.py:864
msgid "Set aside for now. Hide the object, and keep searching through it"
msgstr ""
"Mes de costat per ara. Amagar l'objècte e contunhar la recèrca a travèrs el"

#: WhatsNext.py:870
msgid "Prune tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta Podat"

#: WhatsNext.py:871
msgid "Dead end. Hide the object, and stop searching through it"
msgstr ""
"Camin sens sortida. Amagar l'objècte e arrestar la recèrca a travèrs el"

#: WhatsNext.py:888
msgid "Show suggested 👣 Next Steps"
msgstr "Afichar las 👣 etapas seguentas suggeridas"

#: WhatsNext.py:891
msgid ""
"Show the guidance steps and the 👣 suggestions. Turn off for a shorter list"
msgstr ""
"Afichar las etapas de guidatge e las 👣 suggestions. Desactivar per una lista"
" mai corta"

#: WhatsNext.py:1277
msgid "_Review (open editor)"
msgstr "_Examinar (dobrir l'editor)"

#: WhatsNext.py:1287
msgid "Tag as Complete"
msgstr "Etiquetar coma Acabat"

#: WhatsNext.py:1288
msgid "Tag to Ignore"
msgstr "Etiquetar d'ignorar"

#: WhatsNext.py:1289
msgid "Tag to Prune"
msgstr "Etiquetar de podar"

#: WhatsNext.py:1529
#, python-format
msgid "Tag as %s"
msgstr "Etiquetar coma %s"

#: WhatsNext.py:1613
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ The current Tree database contains no people.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ La basa de donadas de l'arbre actual conten pas cap de persona.\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:1616
msgid ""
"\n"
" 👣 Next Steps:\n"
" Add a Family and a person in that family:\n"
"  • A Family may be added via the \"Add\" menu\n"
"  • A person may be added by pressing the \"+\" (plus) in the spouse (\"Father/partner1\" or \"Mother/partner2\") panels or \"Children\" tab.\n"
"\n"
"Or Import People from an external file:\n"
"  • An external file may be used to populate the tree via \"Import...\" in the \"Family Trees\" menu."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 👣 Etapas seguentas :\n"
" Apondètz una familha e una persona dins aquesta familha :\n"
"  • Una familha pòt èsser apondida pel menú « Apondre »\n"
"  • Una persona pòt èsser apondida en clicant « + » (mai) dins los panèls dels conjunts (« Paire/conjunt1 » o « Maire/conjunt2 ») o dins l'onglet « Enfants ».\n"
"\n"
"O importatz de personas a partir d'un fichièr extèrne :\n"
"  • Un fichièr extèrne pòt servir a emplenar l'arbre via « Importar... » dins lo menú « Arbres familials »."

#: WhatsNext.py:1632
msgid ""
"\n"
" ⛔ No Person has been chosen as the focal \"Home Person\".\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" ⛔ Cap de persona es pas estada causida coma « Persona per defaut » centrala.\n"

#: WhatsNext.py:1635
msgid ""
"\n"
" 👣 Next Steps:\n"
"  •  Select the People view icon in the Navigator sidebar.\n"
"  •  Select someone to make them the \"Active Person\".\n"
"  •  Choose \"Set Home Person\" from the Edit menu or from the (right-click) context menu.\n"
"\n"
" This sets them as the focal \"Home Person\"."
msgstr ""
"\n"
" 👣 Etapas seguentas :\n"
"  •  Seleccionatz l'icòna de la vista Personas dins la barra laterala del Navigador.\n"
"  •  Seleccionatz qualqu'un per ne far la « Persona activa ».\n"
"  •  Causissètz « Definir coma persona per defaut » dins lo menú Edicion o dins lo menú contextual (clic dreit).\n"
"\n"
" Aital ven la « Persona per defaut » centrala."

#: WhatsNext.py:1645
msgid "Double-click color text to edit details"
msgstr "Doble clic sul tèxte en color per modificar los detalhs"

#: WhatsNext.py:1664
msgid "focal Home Person"
msgstr "Persona per defaut centrala"

